{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2020-06-18 09:30:00', 'title': 'APOLLO ANNOUNCES FURTHER EXPANSION OF ITS INSURANCE ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS', 'text': 'APOLLO ANNOUNCES FURTHER EXPANSION OF ITS INSURANCE ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS.APOLLO GLOBAL - ENTERED INTO FIXED ANNUITY BLOCK REINSURANCE TRANSACTION WITH JACKSON, A SUBSIDIARY OF PRUDENTIAL PLC.APOLLO GLOBAL MANAGEMENT - UNDER TERMS, ATHENE WILL REINSURE $27 BILLION IN-FORCE BLOCK OF FIXED DEFERRED AND FIXED INDEXED ANNUITIES.APOLLO GLOBAL- ATHENE WILL MAKE $500 MILLION EQUITY INVESTMENT IN JACKSON, REPRESENTING 11% STAKE IN CO.APOLLO GLOBAL MANAGEMENT - ATHENE WILL ALSO MAKE $500 MILLION EQUITY INVESTMENT IN JACKSON NATIONAL LIFE INSURANCE CO, REPRESENTING AN 11% STAKE.APOLLO GLOBAL MANAGEMENT - EXPECTS JACKSON DEAL WILL BE IMMEDIATELY ACCRETIVE.APOLLO GLOBAL MANAGEMENT - FULL FINANCIAL EFFECT OF JACKSON TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE ACHIEVED ON RUN RATE BASIS IN H2 2021.'}